ITEM B4 — Radiation Decision & Hargreaves-Samani ETo Adoption
------------------------------------------------------------
1. Radiation Data Status:
   - surface_solar_radiation_downwards (SSRD) is NOT cached in the repository.
2. Method Decision:
   - Switched ETo calculation from FAO-56 Penman-Monteith to Hargreaves-Samani (1985).
   - Stopped attempting FAO-56 Penman-Monteith.
3. Justification:
   - Hargreaves-Samani requires only daily Tmax, Tmin, and extraterrestrial radiation (Ra), which is evaluated
     analytically from latitude and day of year (FAO-56 Eq. 21–28), eliminating dependence on missing solar radiation fields.


