ITEM B1 & B6 — Materiality Labelling
------------------------------------
1. Noise Floor Provenance:
   - Plateau baseline Plain ERA5 MAE = 0.751 °C (docs/deterministic_validation.md:81).
2. Materiality Threshold:
   - At Gamma = 6.5 °C/km, relief of 150 m yields |dT| = 150 * 0.0065 = 0.975 °C (~0.97 °C).
   - Because 0.975 °C > 0.751 °C, physical correction strictly exceeds the baseline noise floor.
3. Distribution Across 16,943 Villages:
